Noto Sans Condensed (Condensed, Condensed SemiBold, Condensed Bold): the
hinted files AsteroidOS ships (github.com/AsteroidOS/asteroid-fonts),
subset to Latin with fonttools pyftsubset, hinting kept.
Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL.txt).
Qt registers them as family "Noto Sans" with those style names; ask for
them with font.family "Noto Sans" and font.styleName.
